ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高♯俐香"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎧 期待していない自分/けやき坂46\n♩17"}],"source":"official"}}